# The refine helper uses the `claude` CLI (your Claude Code / Anthropic
# subscription) — there is NO API key to set. Just make sure you're logged in:
# run `claude` once in a terminal if it asks you to authenticate.
#
# Everything below is OPTIONAL. Copy to .env only if you want to override a default.

# Which model the CLI uses for rewrites (any alias the claude CLI accepts).
# REFINE_MODEL=haiku

# Port the helper listens on. If you change it, also update HELPER in extension/background.js.
# REFINE_PORT=8730

# Path to the claude binary, if it isn't on PATH.
# CLAUDE_BIN=claude
